{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2022-06-16 15:00:00', 'title': 'SYNOPSYS BOOSTS 5G SOC DEVELOPMENT PRODUCTIVITY WITH NEW RF DESIGN FLOW FOR TSMC N6RF PROCESS', 'text': 'WITH HIGH-QUALITY, TIGHTLY INTEGRATED RFIC DESIGN PRODUCTS FROM SYNOPSYS, ANSYS AND KEYSIGHT, FLOW FACILITATES POWER AND PERFORMANCE OPTIMIZATIONS FOR N6 WIRELESS SYSTEMS MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF. , JUNE 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ADDRESSING INCREASINGLY COMPLEX RFIC DESIGN REQUIREMENTS, SYNOPSYS, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ:\xa0SNPS) TODAY ANNOUNCED A NEW RF DESIGN FLOW DEVELOPED WITH ANSYS AND KEYSIGHT FOR THE TSMC N6RF PROCESS, THE MOST ADVANCED RF CMOS TECHNOLOGY THAT OFFERS SIGNIFICANT PERFORMANCE AND POWER EFFICIENCY BOOSTS.'}